{
 "version": 1,
 "id": "matematicas-2010-reserva-3",
 "asignatura": "matematicas",
 "anio": 2010,
 "convocatoria": "Reserva 3",
 "documento": "MAT-2010-RESERVA_3.pdf",
 "ejercicios": [
  {
   "id": "matematicas-2010-reserva-3-1",
   "n": 1,
   "num": 1,
   "bloque": "Opción A",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Sea la función \\(f:\\mathbb R\\to\\mathbb R\\) dada por \\(f(x)=\\begin{cases}e^x(x^2+ax)&\\text{si }x\\le0\\\\\\dfrac{bx^2+c}{x+1}&\\text{si }x\\gt0\\end{cases}\\) Calcula las constantes \\(a\\), \\(b\\) y \\(c\\) sabiendo que \\(f\\) es derivable y que la recta tangente a la gráfica de \\(f\\) en el punto de abscisa \\(x=1\\) tiene pendiente 3.",
    "apartados": []
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Resolución",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Cada trozo es derivable en su intervalo abierto (\\(x+1\\neq0\\) si \\(x\\gt0\\)). Estudio \\(x=0\\).</p><p><b>Continuidad</b> (necesaria para ser derivable<i class='n' data-t='th'>Si una función es derivable en un punto, es continua en él.</i>): \\(f(0)=e^0(0+0)=0\\) y \\(\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to0^+}\\frac{bx^2+c}{x+1}=c\\). Así \\(\\boxed{c=0}\\).</p><p><b>Derivabilidad.</b> Con \\(c=0\\):</p>\\[f'(x)=\\begin{cases}e^x(x^2+ax)+e^x(2x+a)&\\text{si }x\\lt0\\\\\\dfrac{2bx(x+1)-bx^2}{(x+1)^2}=\\dfrac{b(x^2+2x)}{(x+1)^2}&\\text{si }x\\gt0\\end{cases}\\]<p>\\(f'(0^-)=a\\) y \\(f'(0^+)=0\\), así que \\(\\boxed{a=0}\\).</p><p><b>Pendiente 3 en </b>\\(x=1\\)<b>:</b> \\(f'(1)=\\dfrac{b\\cdot3}{4}=3\\iff\\boxed{b=4}\\).</p><div class='res'>\\(a=0,\\ b=4,\\ c=0\\)</div></div>"
    }
   ],
   "clasificacion": [
    {
     "tema": "funciones",
     "tipo": "cont",
     "apartados": ""
    },
    {
     "tema": "funciones",
     "tipo": "tang",
     "apartados": ""
    }
   ],
   "origen": {
    "documento": "MAT-2010-RESERVA_3.pdf"
   },
   "dificultad": null,
   "etiquetas": [],
   "revision": "borrador"
  },
  {
   "id": "matematicas-2010-reserva-3-2",
   "n": 2,
   "num": 2,
   "bloque": "Opción A",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Dada la función \\(f\\) definida por \\(f(x)=\\dfrac3{x^2-5x+4}\\) para \\(x\\neq1\\) y \\(x\\neq4\\). Calcula el área del recinto limitado por la gráfica de \\(f\\), el eje de abscisas, y las rectas \\(x=2\\), \\(x=3\\).",
    "apartados": []
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Resolución",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>\\(x^2-5x+4=(x-1)(x-4)\\) es negativo en \\((1,4)\\): en \\([2,3]\\) la función es negativa y el recinto queda por debajo del eje. El área es el valor absoluto de la integral<i class='n' data-t='why'>Si \\(f\\lt0\\), la integral sale negativa; el área es su valor absoluto.</i>.</p><div style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 300 200' width='100%' style='max-width:380px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><polygon points='117.5,60.0 119.1,60.0 120.7,60.0 122.4,60.0 124.0,60.0 125.6,60.0 127.2,60.0 128.9,60.0 130.5,60.0 132.1,60.0 133.8,60.0 135.4,60.0 137.0,60.0 138.6,60.0 140.2,60.0 141.9,60.0 143.5,60.0 145.1,60.0 146.8,60.0 148.4,60.0 150.0,60.0 151.6,60.0 153.2,60.0 154.9,60.0 156.5,60.0 158.1,60.0 159.8,60.0 161.4,60.0 163.0,60.0 164.6,60.0 166.2,60.0 167.9,60.0 169.5,60.0 171.1,60.0 172.8,60.0 174.4,60.0 176.0,60.0 177.6,60.0 179.2,60.0 180.9,60.0 182.5,60.0 182.5,100.0 180.9,99.5 179.2,99.1 177.6,98.7 176.0,98.3 174.4,97.9 172.8,97.6 171.1,97.3 169.5,97.0 167.9,96.8 166.2,96.6 164.6,96.4 163.0,96.2 161.4,96.0 159.8,95.9 158.1,95.8 156.5,95.7 154.9,95.6 153.2,95.6 151.6,95.6 150.0,95.6 148.4,95.6 146.8,95.6 145.1,95.6 143.5,95.7 141.9,95.8 140.2,95.9 138.6,96.0 137.0,96.2 135.4,96.4 133.8,96.6 132.1,96.8 130.5,97.0 128.9,97.3 127.2,97.6 125.6,97.9 124.0,98.3 122.4,98.7 120.7,99.1 119.1,99.5 117.5,100.0' fill='#b9a4f5' fill-opacity='.55'/><polyline points='68.8,176.4 71.5,161.3 74.2,150.0 76.9,141.3 79.6,134.3 82.3,128.7 85.0,124.0 87.7,120.1 90.4,116.7 93.1,113.9 95.8,111.4 98.5,109.3 101.2,107.4 104.0,105.8 106.7,104.3 109.4,103.0 112.1,101.9 114.8,100.9 117.5,100.0 120.2,99.2 122.9,98.5 125.6,97.9 128.3,97.4 131.0,97.0 133.8,96.6 136.5,96.3 139.2,96.0 141.9,95.8 144.6,95.7 147.3,95.6 150.0,95.6 152.7,95.6 155.4,95.7 158.1,95.8 160.8,96.0 163.5,96.3 166.2,96.6 169.0,97.0 171.7,97.4 174.4,97.9 177.1,98.5 179.8,99.2 182.5,100.0 185.2,100.9 187.9,101.9 190.6,103.0 193.3,104.3 196.0,105.8 198.8,107.4 201.5,109.3 204.2,111.4 206.9,113.9 209.6,116.7 212.3,120.1 215.0,124.0 217.7,128.7 220.4,134.3 223.1,141.3 225.8,150.0 228.5,161.3 231.2,176.4' fill='none' stroke='#2f6df0' stroke-width='2'/><line x1='52.5' y1='180.0' x2='52.5' y2='20.0' stroke='#94a3b8' stroke-width='1.4' stroke-dasharray='5 4'/><line x1='247.5' y1='180.0' x2='247.5' y2='20.0' stroke='#94a3b8' stroke-width='1.4' stroke-dasharray='5 4'/><line x1='117.5' y1='60.0' x2='117.5' y2='100.0' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.4' stroke-dasharray='5 4'/><line x1='182.5' y1='60.0' x2='182.5' y2='100.0' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.4' stroke-dasharray='5 4'/><g stroke='currentColor' fill='none' stroke-width='1.2'><path d='M12.0 60.0H294.0M-12.5 194.0V8.0'/></g><line x1='52.5' y1='57.0' x2='52.5' y2='63.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='49.5' y='74.0' font-size='10'>1</text><line x1='117.5' y1='57.0' x2='117.5' y2='63.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='114.5' y='74.0' font-size='10'>2</text><line x1='182.5' y1='57.0' x2='182.5' y2='63.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='179.5' y='74.0' font-size='10'>3</text><line x1='247.5' y1='57.0' x2='247.5' y2='63.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='244.5' y='74.0' font-size='10'>4</text><line x1='-15.5' y1='113.3' x2='-9.5' y2='113.3' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='-28.5' y='117.3' font-size='10'>-2</text><line x1='-15.5' y1='166.7' x2='-9.5' y2='166.7' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='-28.5' y='170.7' font-size='10'>-4</text></svg></div><p>Fracciones simples: \\(\\dfrac3{(x-1)(x-4)}=\\dfrac A{x-1}+\\dfrac B{x-4}\\). Con \\(x=1\\): \\(A=-1\\); con \\(x=4\\): \\(B=1\\).</p><p>Por la regla de Barrow<i class='n' data-t='th'>Regla de Barrow: \\(\\int_a^bf(x)\\,dx=F(b)-F(a)\\), siendo \\(F\\) una primitiva de \\(f\\).</i>:</p>\\[\\int_2^3\\frac{3\\,dx}{x^2-5x+4}=\\Bigl[\\ln|x-4|-\\ln|x-1|\\Bigr]_2^3=(0-\\ln2)-(\\ln2-0)=-2\\ln2\\]<div class='res'>Área \\(=2\\ln2\\approx1{,}386\\ u^2\\)</div></div>"
    }
   ],
   "clasificacion": [
