lor' fill='none' stroke-width='1.2'><path d='M12.0 131.7H294.0M85.0 214.0V8.0'/></g><line x1='30.8' y1='128.7' x2='30.8' y2='134.7' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='27.8' y='145.7' font-size='10'>-1</text><line x1='139.2' y1='128.7' x2='139.2' y2='134.7' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='136.2' y='145.7' font-size='10'>1</text><line x1='193.3' y1='128.7' x2='193.3' y2='134.7' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='190.3' y='145.7' font-size='10'>2</text><line x1='247.5' y1='128.7' x2='247.5' y2='134.7' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='244.5' y='145.7' font-size='10'>3</text><line x1='82.0' y1='193.8' x2='88.0' y2='193.8' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='69.0' y='197.8' font-size='10'>-2</text><line x1='82.0' y1='69.7' x2='88.0' y2='69.7' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='69.0' y='73.7' font-size='10'>2</text></svg></div>\\[A=\\int_0^2(2x-x^2)\\,dx+\\int_2^3(x^2-2x)\\,dx=\\Bigl[x^2-\\frac{x^3}3\\Bigr]_0^2+\\Bigl[\\frac{x^3}3-x^2\\Bigr]_2^3=\\frac43+\\left(0+\\frac43\\right)=\\frac83\\]<div class='res'>Área \\(=\\dfrac83\\ u^2\\)</div></div>"
